Subject: Cantor Read Only Live Codex Adapter

Description: Implementation authority for one operator-explicit, ephemeral, read-only Codex App Server turn that calls exactly one existing Cantor MCP query_sop tool, returns one schema-bound candidate, and enters the already proved deterministic ecosystem review without write or effect authority.

@ [source] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-07-30_cantor_read_only_live_codex_activation\Cantor_Read_Only_Live_Codex_Activation_Source_Selection.sop
@ [reconciliation_source] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-07-30_cantor_read_only_live_codex_activation\Cantor_Read_Only_Live_Codex_Implementation_Reconciliation_Source.sop
